ABHA Mobile (PHR) Application is a reference PHR application available on Android platform. The application can help in creation of an ABHA address, linking & viewing of health records and managing user consents. ABDM has revamped the Ayushman Bharat Health Account (ABHA) mobile application on Android platform with a new User Interface (UI) and new functionalities. The all new ABHA app in sandbox environment can be downloaded from below link:https://sandbox.abdm.gov.in/docs/phr_app

### Registration & Login (As Per Revised Architecture)

The mobile app an individual can register for a ABHA Address in one of the following ways

S.No.FeaturesDescription1ABHA Address Registration with self-declared information
- • Create an ABHA address of the format abc@abdm via mobile no / email ID using self-declared profile information filled in by an individual, such as photo, name, date of birth, gender, address. Mobile number is entered in profile info, in case a user is registering through mobile number and email ID is entered in profile info, in case a user is registering through email ID.
- • Individual creates an easy to remember ABHA Address along with its password to login
- • Profile is completed with an ABHA Address and a QR Code (with self-declared information filled in)2ABHA Registration with 14-Digit ABHA Number* (KYC verified)
- • In this flow Individual is given an option of creating ‘ABHA address through ABHA (Number) via KYC document. Please note, the list of KYC documents may be revised from time to time.
