- • Individual creates an easy to remember ABHA Address along with its password to login- Individuals may link/unlink ABHA (Number) with ABHA address as per their choice.

An individual can now login on the ABHA Mobile Application in one of the following ways:

S.No.FeaturesDescription1Login with mobile number / email ID
