## Share Patient profile with HIP 2.0 (Beta)

API Share Patient profile with HIP 2.0 (Beta)new-tab-icon.svg

## Overview Of The Functionality

The User/Patient can share his/her basic KYC information with the HMIS/LIMS by scanning the QR Code using the integrator application (Example: ABHA App). This enables the user/patients to complete the seamless profile share during their visit.

The authenticity of the profile information is verified by the HIE-CM internally before sharing the data with the HMIS/LIMS and before generating and further adding a linking token (Validity of 6 Months) along with the payload which can be used to link the health records through the HIP-initiated Linking service.

