## Health Record Sharing 2.0 (Beta)

## Overview Of The Functionality

The process of Data flow starts once the HIECM has generated Consent artefact (Consent artefact is generated only if the status of Consent request is “Grant”) and same is notified to HIP and HIU. HIU sends pushback url to HIP via HIECM. HIP, now bundles the care context or Health data of the patient as per FHIR standards and share the data via pushback data url.

HIECM is notified the status of the data shared both by HIU and HIP.

