## ABHA Registration Via Document 2.0 (Beta)

## Overview Of The Functionality

ABHA Number can be obtained via self-registration using documents as KYC with valid user consent where user is giving his consent to create ABHA number.

ABHA enrolment using Aadhaar has strong KYC validation, Once user is successfully authenticated system should generate 14 digit ABHA number.

Following Are The Steps To Successfully Integrate The ABHA Registration Via Aadhaar

- Expect Aadhaar number as an input from the user.
- To enable beneficiary registration using Aadhaar OTP, an integrator needs to generate an Aadhaar OTP, followed by OTP verification
- Once the OTP is verified, system should returned complete profile data along with14 digit ABHA (Health ID) Number to the user.
- System should ask the beneficiary to link mobile number incase user wants to change Aadhaar linked mobile number.

