## Pre- Login Functionality 2.0 (Beta)

## Overview Of The Functionality

User can login to his/her profile by below methods

- Login through Aadhaar number
- Login through ABHA number
- Login through password
- Login through mobile number

Login Through Aadhaar NumberUser inputs ABHA number and receives OTP on the mobile number linked to his Aadhaar number. Once the OTP is authenticated user is successfully logged in his/her Account

Login Through ABHA NumberUser inputs ABHA number and receives OTP on the mobile number linked to his ABHA number. Once the OTP is authenticated user is successfully logged in his/her Account

Login Through PasswordUser inputs ABHA number and then enter his/her password. Once the password is authenticated user is successfully logged in to his/her Account

Login Through Mobile Number

Process followed here is as follows

- User inputs Mobile number, receives OTP on the mobile number entered.
- Once the OTP is authenticated, User gets a list of all the ABHA number(ACTIVE and DEACTIVATED) linked to the entered mobile number.
- User chooses the ABHA number he wants to log in and user is now successfully logged in the ABHA number Account

