## ABHA Generation By DL 2.0 (Beta)

## 1.Overview Of The Functionality

To create ABHA using driving license first user must obtain an enrolment number. Enrolment number can be obtained via self-registration using driving license as KYC with valid user consent.

ABHA enrolment using driving license has strong KYC validation, Once user is successfully authenticated system should generate 14 digit ABHA enrolment number.

Following Are The Steps To Successfully Integrate The ABHA Registration Via Driving License.

Mobile number to be accepted as an input from the user to linked with ABHA number.

User should enter the OTP which he/she received on the provide mobile number, along with OTP user must solve captcha (mathematical problem) to verify himself/herself.

User should fill in his Driving license number, demographic details like First name, middle name, last name, DOB, Address, pin code. User should also upload his Driving license documents.

Once all the details are validated the system should generate a 14-Digit ABHA enrolment number.

