### Q18. What is HIU (Health Information User)?

HIU is an entity that wants to access digital health information from HIPs, in order to provide services to the patient to whom the information belongs. An HIU can be a hospital, clinic, healthcare technology company, organization working on health analytics, insurers, medical researchers and government entities

