### Q28. Is WASA required for entire application or specific module?

The WASA is required for the entire application or specific module as per the requirement. The WASA for entire application is required if no WASA has been conducted for the application before moving to the production. The WASA is required separately for all modules if modules are being developed sequentially. For example, for an application 'XYZ' (in production for which WASA certificate has already been issued) an additional module A has been added. The WASA only needs to be conducted for the sequential module A subtracting the application part 'XYZ'.

