### Q33. What happens when HIU sends requests for a health record?

When HIU sends request for sharing historical health data, the flow begins when the HIU (e.g., a Doctor at a Hospital) requests consent to view the patient’s data. Upon receipt of such a request from Gateway, HIECM acknowledges and sends back a consent request ID to the HIU via the gateway. The HIECM then notifies the patient that an HIU has made a consent request. The patient can view the request details and choose to either grant consent or deny it.

